      {
        "author_name": "Bria Alexis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111364800991004437070/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1-AfpcWPiIkw4xcfeBDgMHeb_oBvi6NRgGu-zllL1pqr0QK3xCg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "2nd time going to Spa Rose Nails\n\nI will now ONLY go here.\n\nI discovered this nail salon while looking for a place to repair 2 severely broken nails and fix what another salon has botched\n\nAlex was meticulous in supporting the broken nails, fixing them so they would not break and styled them the way I wanted. After fixing my nails, cleaning my cuticles, slaying the polish, and a hand/wrist massage, I walked out of there confidently and LOVING my nails.\n\nRDVS in 2 weeks to touch up and pedicure (first time )\n\nNot to mention VERY Competitive and inexpensive pricing.",
        "time": 1752767518,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Quratulain Atif",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110707828238272644734/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWqzbcZWlncxSMlSXwYpY7PuFP0S4Fbkl03YC5reE6wagaeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Worst service ever. So unprofessional did not soak hands in water and started to remove cuticle which was obvious it will bleed without getting them soft by soaking and then no scrubbing at all didn’t even ask to turn on the massage chair or curtesy to ask for water or anything. I wouldn’t recommend this to anyone. Waste of money and time.",
        "time": 1756593580,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A R",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113792304312058431868/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMQb-qnfXSSM51NupWwWpx-leJJIScKw_wJTCK-7x1UbuH8Vv-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE EVER. They do not understand what you want and give you what they like instead. My mom wanted a small flower on her toe and she gave her white nail polish instead and told her they can’t do it because they already started putting white nail polish instead. My mother and I have been there 3 times and we have not liked our experiences. The quality of the products are cheap.",
        "time": 1685136315,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy/Rene Sallafranque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105848454693059903114/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTkXBWySQXkqXFUDc9uHuHzVhys7OtW_dqClrC7zLgbhO8Vwjx2A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "Lovely…..I wish I had had these nails for my wedding ( 49 years ago) I asked for ombré and then Amy added silver fairy dust…magic!",
        "time": 1739839144,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marcia C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105141643082639628017/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6VC8aGDqk8-d2GlZ4xjUEfIqxuFArbOgqtUzr_aWZRpkFkAoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I love the atmosphere and services of Spa Rose nails. Lily and her staff are very kind, friendly and professional. I had my nails done a few times and loved it every time. I also enjoyed a relaxing massage once, it was great!",
        "time": 1748201921,
